Java program code to calculate duration between two dates while considering time zones:

```java
import java.time.Duration;
import java.time.ZoneId;
import java.time.ZonedDateTime;

public class DateDurationCalculator {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        // Set the starting and ending date/time with respective time zones
